 begin="00:35.705" end="00:35.896">the </span><span begin="00:35.896" end="00:36.247">way </span><span begin="00:36.247" end="00:36.550">you </span><span begin="00:36.550" end="00:36.781">did </span><span begin="00:36.781" end="00:37.164">so </span><span begin="00:37.164" end="00:37.931">easily</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.434" end="00:40.532"><span begin="00:39.434" end="00:39.665">Don't </span><span begin="00:39.665" end="00:40.242">wanna </span><span begin="00:40.242" end="00:40.532">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.207" end="00:42.992"><span begin="00:41.207" end="00:41.366">What </span><span begin="00:41.366" end="00:41.517">kind </span><span begin="00:41.517" end="00:41.724">of </span><span begin="00:41.724" end="00:41.947">dress </span><span begin="00:41.947" end="00:42.202">you're </span><span begin="00:42.202" end="00:42.513">wearing </span><span begin="00:42.513" end="00:42.992">tonight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.711" end="00:45.356"><span begin="00:43.711" end="00:43.846">If </span><span begin="00:43.846" end="00:44.005">he's </span><span begin="00:44.005" end="00:44.292">holding </span><span begin="00:44.292" end="00:44.567">onto </span><span begin="00:44.567" end="00:44.758">you </span><span begin="00:44.758" end="00:45.077">so </span><span begin="00:45.077" end="00:45.356">tight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.227" end="00:47.718"><span begin="00:46.227" end="00:46.402">The </span><span begin="00:46.402" end="00:46.577">way </span><span begin="00:46.577" end="00:46.824">I </span><span begin="00:46.824" end="00:47.103">did </span><span begin="00:47.103" end="00:47.718">before</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.235" end="00:50.577"><span begin="00:49.235" end="00:49.546">I </span><span begin="00:49.546" end="00:50.577">overdosed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.907" end="00:52.629"><span begin="00:50.907" end="00:51.050">Should've </span><span begin="00:51.050" end="00:51.305">known </span><span begin="00:51.305" end="00:51.560">your </span><span begin="00:51.560" end="00:51.903">love </span><span begin="00:51.903" end="00:52.102">was </span><span begin="00:52.102" end="00:52.269">a </span><span begin="00:52.269" end="00:52.629">game</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.267" end="00:55.034"><span begin="00:53.267" end="00:53.402">Now </span><span begin="00:53.402" end="00:53.545">I </span><span begin="00:53.545" end="00:53.768">can't </span><span begin="00:53.768" end="00:53.935">get </span><span begin="00:53.935" end="00:54.094">you </span><span begin="00:54.094" end="00:54.317">out </span><span begin="00:54.317" end="00:54.476">of </span><span begin="00:54.476" end="00:54.715">my </span><span begin="00:54.715" end="00:55.034">brain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.619" end="00:57.349"><span begin="00:55.619" end="00:56.074">Oh </span><span begin="00:56.074" end="00:56.322">it's </span><span begin="00:56.322" end="00:56.609">such </span><span begin="00:56.609" end="00:56.920">a </span><span begin="00:56.920" end="00:57.349">shame</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.235" end="01:01.948"><span begin="00:58.235" end="00:58.369">That </span><span begin="00:58.369" end="00:58.520">we </span><span begin="00:58.520" end="00:58.767">don't </span><span begin="00:58.767" end="00:59.101">talk </span><span begin="00:59.101" end="01:00.588">anymore </span><span begin="01:00.588" end="01:00.772">we </span><span begin="01:00.772" end="01:01.114">don't </span><span begin="01:01.114" end="01:01.433">talk </span><span begin="01:01.433" end="01:01.948">anymore</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.025" end="01:07.056"><span begin="01:03.025" end="01:03.192">We </span><span begin="01:03.192" end="01:03.519">don't </span><span begin="01:03.519" end="01:03.862">talk </span><span begin="01:03.862" end="01:04.589">anymore </span><span begin="01:04.589" end="01:05.060">like </span><span begin="01:05.060" end="01:05.443">we </span><span begin="01:05.443" end=