 end="01:22.501"><span begin="01:20.749" end="01:20.940">Who </span><span begin="01:20.940" end="01:21.115">knows </span><span begin="01:21.115" end="01:21.410">how </span><span begin="01:21.410" end="01:21.593">to </span><span begin="01:21.593" end="01:21.848">love </span><span begin="01:21.848" end="01:22.087">you </span><span begin="01:22.087" end="01:22.278">like </span><span begin="01:22.278" end="01:22.501">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.493" end="01:25.988"><span begin="01:23.493" end="01:23.644">There </span><span begin="01:23.644" end="01:23.827">must </span><span begin="01:23.827" end="01:24.050">be </span><span begin="01:24.050" end="01:24.265">a </span><span begin="01:24.265" end="01:24.600">good </span><span begin="01:24.600" end="01:25.287">reason </span><span begin="01:25.287" end="01:25.518">that </span><span begin="01:25.518" end="01:25.701">you're </span><span begin="01:25.701" end="01:25.988">gone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.141" end="01:29.175"><span begin="01:27.141" end="01:27.678">Every </span><span begin="01:27.678" end="01:27.949">now </span><span begin="01:27.949" end="01:28.188">and </span><span begin="01:28.188" end="01:28.515">then </span><span begin="01:28.515" end="01:28.722">I </span><span begin="01:28.722" end="01:29.000">think </span><span begin="01:29.000" end="01:29.175">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.182" end="01:32.128"><span begin="01:29.182" end="01:29.341">Might </span><span begin="01:29.341" end="01:29.736">want </span><span begin="01:29.736" end="01:29.903">me </span><span begin="01:29.903" end="01:30.190">to </span><span begin="01:30.190" end="01:30.597">come </span><span begin="01:30.597" end="01:30.876">show </span><span begin="01:30.876" end="01:31.147">up </span><span begin="01:31.147" end="01:31.442">at </span><span begin="01:31.442" end="01:31.849">your </span><span begin="01:31.849" end="01:32.128">door</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.170" end="01:35.753"><span begin=